.TH okf-jawn-export_workspace 1  "export_workspace " 
.SH NAME
okf\-jawn\-export_workspace \- Build a portable export with resolvable referenced assets.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBokf\-jawn export_workspace\fR [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build a portable export with resolvable referenced assets.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR [default: http://127.0.0.1:7711]

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR [default: {}]
JSON request, @file, or \- for stdin
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
